🤖 Gemma Description

Gemma is a family of lightweight, open-weight Artificial Intelligence models developed by Google. It was introduced in 2024 
and is based on the research and technology behind Google's Gemini models.


=========

Gemma allows developers to build, customize, fine-tune, and deploy AI applications

such as chatbots, RAG systems, AI agents, content generators, and domain-specific AI solutions

Depending on the model version and hardware, Gemma can run locally or on cloud platforms such as Google Cloud Vertex AI.

